stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Candidate: eval gates pass
  Candidate --> Challenger: registered + awaiting approval or auto-promote
  Challenger --> Canary: serving rollout starts at 1 percent
  Canary --> Champion: SLOs held at 100 percent
  Canary --> RolledBack: SLO regression - auto-rollback
  RolledBack --> Candidate: postmortem traces enter golden set
  Champion --> Archived: superseded by new champion
  Archived --> Champion: emergency rollback - alias move
